-- Arguments: the speed, a service described in subsection (a)?, a service described in subsection (c)?
#ASSERT `s 391(h) the most that may be added to the fees for the service` `completed within 30 minutes on the same day as the day of the request` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST 10_000
-- the 30-minute sum is for services described in subsection (a) only
#ASSERT `s 391(h) the most that may be added to the fees for the service` `completed within 30 minutes on the same day as the day of the request` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 391(h) the most that may be added to the fees for the service` `completed within 1 hour on the same day as the day of the request` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST 2_500
#ASSERT `s 391(h) the most that may be added to the fees for the service` `completed within 2 hours on the same day as the day of the request` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST 1_500
#ASSERT `s 391(h) the most that may be added to the fees for the service` `completed within the same day as the day of the request` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST 500
#ASSERT `s 391(h) the most that may be added to the fees for the service` `completed within a 24-hour period from the time of the request` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST 300
#ASSERT `s 391(h) the most that may be added to the fees for the service` `completed within a 24-hour period from the time of the request` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 391(h) the most that may be added to the fees for the service` `completed at a speed that s 391(h) does not name` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
